[
    {
        "id": "cr-c",
        "type": "comment",
        "name": "Cron schedules",
        "info": "`dataops-cron` uses 6 fields: `sec min hour day-of-month month day-of-week`.\n\n| Expression | Fires |\n|---|---|\n| `*/5 * * * * *` | every 5 seconds |\n| `0 * * * * *` | at the top of every minute |\n| `0,30 * * * * *` | at seconds 0 and 30 |\n| `0 0 8 * * 1-5` | 08:00 on weekdays |\n| `0 */15 6-18 * * *` | every 15 min from 06:00 to 18:59 |\n\nEvery message carries `msg.timestamp` (ISO) and `msg._epoch` (ms), aligned to the whole second.",
        "x": 160,
        "y": 40,
        "wires": []
    },
